  "description": "SELKUQ crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C68 H108 Cl10 O4 Sm6,2(C6 H6). From the CIF bond table, Sm1 (Sm) has 1 O neighbors; Sm2 (Sm) has 1 O neighbors; Sm3 (Sm) has 2 O neighbors; Sm1B (Sm) has 1 O neighbors; Sm2B (Sm) has 1 O neighbors; Sm3B (Sm) has 2 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.822-3.869 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 102.01-104.60°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C68H108Cl10O4Sm6·2(C6H6).",
